","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_29_07_e_90","text":"If you start feeling strange, cut off the power to your arms. This will deprive the crystals of their food source, and should cause them to fall off.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_29_07_e_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_29_07_e_91","text":"If you have any questions, let me know and I can show you how to do it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_29_07_e_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_29_07_e_92","text":"Neon. Let's lift this together.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_29_07_e_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_29_07_e_93","text":"Sure thing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_29_07_e_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"drilley","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_29_07_e_94","text":"This one here is a bit tricky. I'll carve it out with my drill.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_29_07_e_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_29_07_e_95","text":"Remove the middle part first and then the bottom bit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_29_07_e_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_29_07_e_96","text":"You don't think that'll cause it to collapse?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt